SPRACHE EN
TEXTE
  1 "Task manager"
  2 "End program (unsaved data will be lost): "
  3 "This is the desktop (SHELL). Without it there is no desktop. End it anyway?"
  4 "Free: "
ENDE
DIALOG 10 "Task manager" 0 0 240 140
  LIST                  40   8   8 224 92 WS_VSCROLL
  STATIC   ""           41   8 104 224 10
  BUTTON   "&End task"  21   8 118  70 14
  BUTTON   "&Refresh"   22  84 118  80 14
